    {"id":"ingest","type":"rectangle","x":20,"y":90,"width":1240,"height":220,"strokeColor":"#0078D4","backgroundColor":"#CFE4FA","fillStyle":"solid"},
    {"id":"ingest-text","type":"text","x":40,"y":110,"width":1200,"height":180,"text":"1. INDEXING (per collection)\nRaw Blob -> Managed indexer -> Custom skill calls Azure Language PII (live)\n-> Backend creates PII tokens -> Embed protected text -> Protected AI Search index\nBackend commits Fernet-encrypted original values to SQLite before publishing chunks.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#000000"},
