    {"id":"a8","type":"arrow","x":1110,"y":360,"width":0,"height":50,"points":[[0,0],[0,-50]],"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","endArrowhead":"arrow"},
    {"id":"note","type":"text","x":20,"y":830,"width":1240,"height":270,"text":"3. RETRIEVAL: agent -> backend function -> Foundry IQ -> protected AI Search evidence.\nThe model reasons on protected question/history and protected source text, not restored originals.\nSQLite path in Azure: /home/data/pii-rag/mappings.sqlite3 (persistent App Service storage).\nPresidio is optional, not used in live validation. Standalone file demo creates no mapping DB.\nFinal answer scan is after model generation; it cannot erase unexpected PII already stored remotely.\nNo new LLM call on reveal/hide. No per-document RBAC yet. Keep DB and key protected.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#000000"}
